.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Tests / tooling
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*

# Project-local verification logs (regenerable)
**/manuscript_verification.log

# Generated project outputs.
#
# `output/` is NOT ignored wholesale: `output/data/*.json` is the measurement
# layer the series gates derive every published number from, and the figures,
# tables, PDFs and formal verdicts are tracked evidence. A blanket `**/output/`
# rule silently dropped every newly generated artifact from `git add`, so a
# re-run pipeline produced a tree the gates could not see on a fresh clone.
# Ignore only the regenerable bulk that no gate reads.
**/.checkpoints/
**/output/web/
**/output/figure-portability/
**/*.aux
**/*.nav
**/*.out
**/*.snm
**/*.toc
**/*.vrb
**/*.blg
**/*.bbl

# Build logs. They record absolute paths of whoever rendered, which is
# machine-specific noise in a public repository and a B7 blocker in the
# publication gate.
output/**/*.log
**/output/**/*.log
manuscript_verification.log
output/reports/output_statistics.txt
**/output/reports/output_statistics.txt
.zenodo-drafts.json
